  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. Must follow suit. If unable, play any card. 2. **Sudden Trump**: The first time someone cannot follow suit, the top card of the talon is turned over. Its suit becomes trumps for the rest of the round. It is then turned back over, and players must remember it. 3. **Exchanging**: Between tricks, a player can offer 'A coat for a coat' (King/Queen/Jack) or 'A card for a card' (Ace/Ten) to trade high-point cards with opponents, provided the suits match.",
    Player: "1. Must follow suit. If unable, play any card. 2. **Sudden Trump**: The first time someone cannot follow suit, the top card of the talon is turned over. Its suit becomes trumps for the rest of the round. It is then turned back over, and players must remember it. 3. **Exchanging**: Between tricks, a player can offer 'A coat for a coat' (King/Queen/Jack) or 'A card for a card' (Ace/Ten) to trade high-point cards with opponents, provided the suits match.",
    objective: 'Avoid reaching 31 points. Point cards: Ace (11), Ten (10), King (3), Queen (2), Jack (1). Total points in deck = 108.',
    gameplay: "1. Must follow suit. If unable, play any card. 2. **Sudden Trump**: The first time someone cannot follow suit, the top card of the talon is turned over. Its suit becomes trumps for the rest of the round. It is then turned back over, and players must remember it. 3. **Exchanging**: Between tricks, a player can offer 'A coat for a coat' (King/Queen/Jack) or 'A card for a card' (Ace/Ten) to trade high-point cards with opponents, provided the suits match.",
    keyRules: [
      'Point cards: Ace=11, Ten=10, King=3, Queen=2, Jack=1.',
      'Must follow suit if possible.',
      'Sudden Trump: First time someone cannot follow, talon top card determines trumps (hidden after reveal).',
      "Can exchange high cards between tricks ('coat for coat', 'card for card').",
      "Reach 31+ points = eliminated ('out').",
      'Last player remaining wins.',
    ],
